# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Order (0.4.3 fix round): Felwood's first pass from the south (the ride in from Azshara's Talrendis Point), up to
# Timbermaw Hold; through the tunnel to western Winterspring on the way to Everlook (Salfa, Donova's first errands,
# Everlook's flight path and Felnok's Chillwind Horns); the flight to Rut'theran Village and Darnassus (Eridan's vial,
# the druids' quests, and since the 2026-11-20 fix pass Erelas' feathers, Jenal's soil, Fandral's errand and Gracina's
# Rise of the Silithid, which the Burning Steppes guide's own Darnassus trip used to take); Feralas' second visit
# (Zorbin's zapping on the Forgotten Coast, Gregan, Rockbiter and Shay),
# ending at Thalanaar. The Winterspring guide used to open with a top-up from 53.6 to 55 at Frostfire (about 246k XP
# for the level model's player) because Winterspring's quests waited for 55-59; Feralas, Un'Goro and the rest of
# Felwood waited for 56-58.

step Felwood
  zone Felwood
  tip From Talrendis Point ride west along the road past Forest Song, then north-west into Felwood: the Emerald Sanctuary is the druids' camp on the road just past the Ashenvale border.
  goto 51.2,82.1 "The Emerald Sanctuary"

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  tip The Emerald Sanctuary is the druids' camp by the road in southern Felwood.
  accept 4101                         -- Arathandris Silversky, in the ruins just east of Grazle
  accept 4421                         -- Eridan Bluewind, inside
  accept 5156                         -- Taronn Redfeather
  accept 5155                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 86577                        -- Kelek Skykeeper: A Sampling of Putrescence, from the bears and wolves you meet in Felwood

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Getting there

step Grazle
  zone Felwood
  tip Grazle the furbolg stands by the road just south of the Emerald Sanctuary.
  accept 8460

step Deadwood Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolgs live in the village just south-west of Grazle; keep the Deadwood Headdress Feathers they drop: Grazle and Nafien each take five.
  collect 21377 x5 optional           -- Deadwood Headdress Feather
  kill 7153 quest 8460.1              -- Deadwood Warrior
  kill 7154 quest 8460.3              -- Deadwood Gardener
  kill 7155 quest 8460.2              -- Deadwood Pathfinder

step Grazle
  turnin 8460
  accept 8462                         -- Nafien waits at the north end of Felwood
  turnin 8466 direct optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The south

step Jadefire Glen
  tip The Jadefire satyrs hold the glen west of the road, with Xavathras at its back.
  tip Careful: Jadefire Shadowstalkers (level 51-52) use Sneak and Slowing Poison and are stealthed, so they often join fights uninvited.
  tip Cursed Oozes slide about the glen's streams: kill them and use Laris's Empty Ooze Jar on their remains.
  kill 7109 quest 4421.1              -- Jadefire Felsworn
  collect 11947 quest 4512.1          -- Filled Cursed Ooze Jar

step Ruins of Constellas
  tip Careful: Xavathras (54) stands at the back of the Ruins of Constellas, at about 32.2,67.1, with Shadowstalkers around him: clear them one at a time, then pull him alone at full health.
  kill 7110 quest 4421.2              -- Jadefire Shadowstalker
  kill 7106 quest 4421.3              -- Jadefire Rogue
  kill 9454 quest 4421.4              -- Xavathras

step Jaedenar
  tip Jaedenar is the ruined temple north of the glen.
  tip Careful: the Spirit of Trey Lightforge (53, elite) haunts the west end of Jaedenar, around 35,60: work the south-east, where the arrow points, and pull the cultists and hounds away from him.
  kill 7125 quest 5155.1 @38.7,61.9   -- Jaedenar Hound
  kill 7113 quest 5155.2 @38.5,61.1   -- Jaedenar Guardian
  kill 7115 quest 5155.3 @38.2,61.5   -- Jaedenar Adept
  kill 7112 quest 5155.4 @38.2,61.1   -- Jaedenar Cultist
  collect 11949 quest 4512.2          -- Filled Tainted Ooze Jar: Tainted Oozes slide about Jaedenar's fel pools

step Putrescent organs: kill these as you meet them
  zone Felwood
  tip Felwood's Angerclaw bears and Felpaw wolves carry the putrescent organs Kelek wants: the Bears and Wolves (47-48) of the south and the Maulers and Scavengers (49-50) along the road north of Jaedenar. Kill them as you ride between the stops.
  collect 277958 quest 86577          -- Putrescent Bear Organs
  collect 277959 quest 86577          -- Putrescent Wolf Organs

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  turnin 5155                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5157
  turnin 4421                         -- Eridan Bluewind, inside
  accept 4906

step Shatter Scar Vale
  tip Follow the road north to the cratered vale and walk to each crater, killing the Entropic Beasts and Horrors between them.
  tip Careful: an Infernal Sentry (53, elite) stands among the craters: walk round it.
  goto 41.6,43.0 "First crater"
  goto 40.4,41.2 "Second crater"
  goto 42.2,40.3 "Third crater"
  complete 5156
  kill 9878 quest 5156.1              -- Entropic Beast
  kill 9879 quest 5156.2              -- Entropic Horror

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The north

step Irontree Woods
  tip The Warpwood treants of Irontree Woods, east of Jadefire Run, carry the Blood Amber.
  collect 11503 quest 4101.1          -- Below ground

step Jadefire Run: kill these as you meet them
  zone Felwood
  tip Jadefire Run is the satyr valley in the north-west, with Xavaric at its far end. He drops the Flute of Xavaric; every Jadefire satyr can drop Jadefire Felbind.
  tip Careful: Xavaric (55) stands at the valley's far end with Hellcallers (53-54) around him: clear them one at a time before you pull him.
  kill 10648 quest 4906.4             -- Xavaric
  collect 11668                       -- Flute of Xavaric
  accept 939
  kill 7107 quest 4906.3              -- Jadefire Trickster
  kill 7108 quest 4906.2              -- Jadefire Betrayer
  kill 7111 quest 4906.1              -- Jadefire Hellcaller
  collect 11674 quest 939.1           -- Jadefire Felbind

step Jaedenar again
  tip Use the Empty Canteen at the corrupted moonwell in the middle of Jaedenar.
  use 12922 quest 5157.1 @35.2,59.8 map 1448
  collect 12907 quest 5157.1

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back south

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  tip Ride south-east from Jaedenar to the Emerald Sanctuary, the druids' camp by the road in southern Felwood.
  turnin 5156                         -- Taronn Redfeather
  turnin 86577                        -- Kelek Skykeeper

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  turnin 939
