# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Timbermaw Hold

step Nafien
  tip Ride north up the road from the Sanctuary, all the way to the cave mouth of Timbermaw Hold; Nafien guards it.
  turnin 8462
  accept 8461

step Felpaw Village
  tip The Deadwood furbolgs of Felpaw Village fill the hills west of the cave.
  tip Careful: Den Watchers are level 53-54 and the Avengers 54-55; they call nearby allies within 25 yd once below 50% health and run off for help below 15%.
  kill 7156 quest 8461.1              -- Deadwood Den Watcher
  kill 7157 quest 8461.2              -- Deadwood Avenger
  kill 7158 quest 8461.3              -- Deadwood Shaman

step Deadwood Ritual Totem
  when rep "Timbermaw Hold" Neutral
  tip Only if the Timbermaw are already Neutral to you: the Deadwood furbolgs drop a Deadwood Ritual Totem about one kill in thirty, and Kernda just inside Timbermaw Hold takes it. Below Neutral the quest is refused: it needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there.
  collect 20741                       -- Deadwood Ritual Totem
  accept 8470 item 20741

step Nafien
  turnin 8461
  accept 8465                         -- Salfa stands at the Winterspring end of the tunnel

step Nafien
  when has 21377 x5
  turnin 8467 direct

step Timbermaw Hold
  when rep "Timbermaw Hold" Neutral
  when onquest 8470
  tip Step into the cave: Kernda stands just inside. She needs Neutral with the Timbermaw; the reputation guide gets you there.
  turnin 8470                         -- Kernda: walks around here: look inside the circle on the map

