# inside it: the arrow led onto a ledge outside, behind the wall, from the ground and from each other's floor alike
# (#1338). Before each of them, a goto at the building's door on its south side, 35.8,11.6 (players' recordings walk
# in there), makes the arrow point straight at him from there.
step Cenarion Enclave
  zone Darnassus
  goto 35.8,11.6 "Cenarion Enclave"

