step Boat to The Forgotten Coast
  zone Feralas
  goto 31.0,39.8 "Boat to The Forgotten Coast"

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  tip Take the boat to the mainland: Zorbin waits on the dock where it lands.
  accept 7003
  accept 7721

step The Forgotten Coast: kill these as you meet them
  zone Feralas
  tip The Sea Sprays (46-47) wash along the shore just south of the dock: they drop the Water Elemental Cores as well as the Sea Elementals (47) do. The Wave and Deep Striders (47) wade in the water off the same beach: zap them with Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker first, and shrunken they lose their elite strength.
  tip The Ultra-Shrinker lasts two hours: hand both quests back to Zorbin before you leave the coast.
  collect 18958 quest 7721.1 @44.94,48.6 map 1444 -- Water Elemental Core, from the Sea Sprays
  use 18904 quest 7003.1 @44.12,49.08 map 1444 -- Zorbin's Ultra-Shrinker, on the Wave and Deep Striders in the water
  collect 18956 quest 7003.1

step Zorbin Fandazzle
  tip Back to Zorbin on the dock.
  turnin 7003
  turnin 7721

step Gregan Brewspewer
  tip Ride north-east from the dock past the Twin Colossals to Gregan's camp. He brews the Videre Elixir from an Evoroot: take his errand for one.
  turnin 4142

step Rockbiter
  tip The giant Rockbiter sits just north-west of Gregan's camp.
  accept 2844

step Evoroot
  tip The Evoroot grows inside a ruined building north of Rockbiter: climb in through the break in its wall from the ledge beside it.
  collect 11242 @44.5,10.2 map 1444 -- Evoroot

step Shay Leafrunner
  tip Ride west into the Ravenwind Ruins: Shay hides in the small round building at the back. Open the chest beside her for Shay's Bell: it lasts 15 minutes, like the quest.
  turnin 2844
  accept 2845
  collect 9189 quest 2845.1           -- Shay's Bell

step Wandering Shay
  tip Lead Shay back to Rockbiter at walking pace: she wanders off, so ring the bell to call her back (not in combat), and clear the harpies on the way before she reaches them.
  complete 2845 @42.3,21.9
  turnin 2845                         -- Rockbiter

step Gregan Brewspewer
  when has 11242
  tip Back to Gregan's camp, just south-east of Rockbiter: the Evoroot buys three Videre Elixirs. Keep them: Donova takes one at the start of the next guide, and Gaeriyan in Gadgetzan shows himself only to someone who has drunk one.
  turnin 4041 direct
  collect 11243 quest 3909.1          -- Videre Elixir

step Feralas
  zone Feralas
  tip Ride east along the road to Thalanaar, on the Thousand Needles border: the next guide flies from there.
  getfp "Thalanaar"
